---
import { PHOREST_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE, PHOREST_FACTS_CHECKED_ISO, PHOREST_SOURCES, PHOREST_TRADEMARK_DISCLAIMER } from '@/lib/seo/phorestFacts';
import { PHOREST_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_ISO, PHOREST_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_LABEL } from '@/lib/seo/phorestAlternativeFaq';
---
<section id="sources" class="fresha-alt-sources" aria-labelledby="phorest-alt-sources-title"><div class="container">
<header class="fresha-alt-sources__header"><h2 id="phorest-alt-sources-title" class="fresha-alt-sources__title">Sources &amp; comparison notes</h2>
<p class="fresha-alt-sources__meta">Phorest facts checked <time datetime={PHOREST_FACTS_CHECKED_ISO}>{PHOREST_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE}</time><span aria-hidden="true">·</span>Last updated <time datetime={PHOREST_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_ISO}>{PHOREST_ALTERNATIVE_LAST_UPDATED_LABEL}</time></p></header>
<p>This comparison draws on Phorest's published UK pricing and its Help Centre. Phorest publishes feature and plan information but asks businesses to request a personalised quote; we do not present an unverified monthly price or fee. Pricing and features can change; confirm current terms with Phorest before choosing a platform.</p>
<ul class="fresha-alt-sources__list">{PHOREST_SOURCES.map(source=><li><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{source.label}</a><span class="fresha-alt-sources__supports">{source.supports}</span></li>)}</ul>
<p class="fresha-alt-sources__trademark">{PHOREST_TRADEMARK_DISCLAIMER}</p>
</div></section>